sequenceDiagram
    title Variant A - flight number captured on guest details
    participant User
    participant SearchWidget
    participant SRP
    participant GuestPage
    participant FinalForm
    participant SaleStore
    participant BFF

    User->>SearchWidget: pickup, destination, date, time, pax
    SearchWidget->>BFF: search async without flightNumber
    BFF-->>SRP: vehicle results
    User->>SRP: taps a VehicleCard
    SRP->>SaleStore: createSale sId and optionId
    SaleStore->>BFF: POST sale
    BFF-->>SRP: saleId
    SRP-->>GuestPage: hard navigate to guest saleId
    GuestPage->>BFF: GET sale
    BFF-->>GuestPage: cart, vehicle, contact, extras
    User->>GuestPage: types flight number in the optional field
    GuestPage->>FinalForm: useField contact.flightNumber
    User->>GuestPage: taps the sticky CTA
    GuestPage->>FinalForm: submitFormRef handleSubmit
    FinalForm->>SaleStore: updateSaleInfo contact, extras, flightNumber
    SaleStore->>BFF: PATCH contact-additional-info
    BFF-->>SaleStore: updated sale with flightDetails
    SaleStore-->>GuestPage: success
    GuestPage-->>User: hard navigate to checkout
